== Effect ==
* Increases Isaac's [[Damage]] by a set amount for each of the following [[item]]s or [[trinket]]s he possesses:
** {{dlc|nr}} +0.2 Damage for each item or trinket possessed.
** {{dlc|r}} +0.5 Damage for each item or trinket possessed.
{{column list | width = 15em | content =
* {{i|Abaddon}}
* {{i|Black Candle}}
* {{t|Black Lipstick}}
* {{i|Ceremonial Robes}}
* {{t|Daemon's Tail}}
* {{i|False PHD}}
* {{i|Goat Head}}
* {{i|The Mark|r+}}
* {{i|Match Book}}
* {{i|Missing Page 2}}
* {{i|The Pact|r+}}
* {{i|Safety Pin}}
}}

== Notes ==
* Having more than one of the same item (i.e. using {{i|Diplopia}} and/or, in the case of trinkets, {{i|Smelter}} or {{i|Mom's Purse}}) will increase Isaac's damage for each copy.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Mom's Box|nr}}: Grants +0.4 damage for each evil item and trinket.
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r}}: Having either grants +1 damage for each evil item and trinket. Having both grants +1.5 damage for each.

